      "message": "Please fix this WARNING reported by autoreview issue finding: Critical bug: `{{ input }}[idx]` is a single `char` if the type name is \u0027char\u0027. `env-\u003eNewStringUTF` expects a null-terminated `const char*`. This will cause a crash or read-out-of-bounds as JNI tries to find a null terminator starting from a single character value.\n\nIf the intention is to support an array of strings (e.g., `const char**`), then `input` needs to be treated as a pointer to pointers, and the type check should reflect that.",
